<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50341" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλ-άρχης</span></b>  (later written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλ-</span></b> , cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βειλάρχας</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴλη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>commander of a troop of horse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				3p.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				31
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.7.3
			</span></i>; = Lat. <i>praefectus turmae</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.25.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.35.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>commander of eight elephants</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				23
			</span></i>:— hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλ-αρχέω</span></b> , 
				Boeot.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝιλαρχίω</span></b> , <i>command
				cavalry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				7.3087
			</span></i> (Lebad.), <i><span class="en">
				3206
			</span></i> (Orchom.), <i><span class="en">
				2466
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thebes</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> at Rome, <i>to be sevir equitum</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				55.10
			</span></i>.</div>
